From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: opencode-port <port@localhost>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 14:08:28 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] D508 code mode: symbols vanish in JSON.stringify and program
 results

Upstream: a symbol value serialized as {}: JSON.stringify(Symbol.iterator) gave "{}" instead of undefined, { a: Symbol.iterator } gave {"a":{}}, and a program returning Symbol.iterator (or { sym: Symbol.iterator }) handed the model {} (or {"sym":{}}), although the conversion is documented as giving what JSON.stringify would (data.ts, tryFastBoundaryOrJson).
Fixed: symbols vanish like undefined and functions: omitted from objects, null in arrays, undefined on their own (a null result). Both engines.
Scenarios: codemode-stdlib-object.test.ts "json parse and stringify" (stringify symbol), "program result boundary" (sym); codemode-lang-errors.test.ts "result boundary and REPL values" (return Symbol.iterator)
Upstream tests: test/codemode.test.ts adds "symbols vanish like undefined, in results and in JSON.stringify"

